{"id":"2526773183","kind":"answer","title":"作为学生应该如何正确对待作业？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2022-06-13","updated":"2022-06-13","votes":47,"comment_count":10,"minutes":2,"chars":837,"keywords":["学习动机","学校教育","自由学习","自我导向学习","非学校教育"],"summary":"学校给的作业，有选择的完成即可。适当给自己选择适合自己的额外作业。 我自己就是高三几乎没写过语文作业，因为我认定语文提分要比英语难得多，就把时间花在刷英语五三题霸和背单词上，把英语从 90+ 提到了 130+。搞笑的是，我语文平时也就 90 多分，高考反而上了 100。 至于为什么这样做，我认为作业应当是由自己选择的，才是最好…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/537126305/answer/2526773183","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"0otE7E3T\">学校给的作业，有选择的完成即可。适当给自己选择适合自己的额外作业。</p><p data-pid=\"ZW5VVpNq\">我自己就是高三几乎没写过语文作业，因为我认定语文提分要比英语难得多，就把时间花在刷英语五三题霸和背单词上，把英语从 90+ 提到了 130+。搞笑的是，我语文平时也就 90 多分，高考反而上了 100。</p><p data-pid=\"BGqxtaSp\">至于为什么这样做，我认为作业应当是由自己选择的，才是最好的。老师布置作业都是给全班布置的，经常不匹配我自己的水平，要么太难（对我而言，比如语文、英语），要么太简单（对我来说，数学、理综）。</p><p data-pid=\"xxOUOWUF\">再让我们看看 woz 博士是怎么评价家庭作业的。</p><p data-pid=\"UT6d5iZz\">以下内容摘自：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-099353413e7fca678e4d5a472f5d35cd_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"905\" data-image-width=\"1280\" data-tm-id=\"501186817\" href=\"#/post/501186817\">叶峻峣：家庭作业</a><p data-pid=\"efAYkcza\"><b>家庭作业</b>基于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Self-learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自学</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。然而，这并不意味着它高效或良好。大多数时候，它不行。</p><p data-pid=\"dg8Xr3Z8\">家庭作业在大多数情况下有害的原因如下：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"8__6wSK7\">材料通常是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coercion_in_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">被强加的</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，而不是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Self-directed_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自主选择的</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。这违反了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Self-directed_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自我导向</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>的原则<br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"XwKiNwUK\">家庭作业通常在晚上做，在错误的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Natural_creativity_cycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜节律时间</a>（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜节律</a>因素）<br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"Ed0sw2c3\">当孩子们开始做家庭作业时，他们通常已经在学校花了很长时间，已经筋疲力尽了（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Homeostatic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自稳态</a>因素）<br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"qzsvutnO\">太费力，工作量太大，学习速度过高，引发<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">干扰</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>而破坏先前的学习（见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Superiority_of_a_rat_over_a_schooled_human\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">论老鼠比受过学校教育的人更优越</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>）<br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"h8mvkNVQ\">违反<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Fundamental_law_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的基本法则</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>导致人们普遍讨厌学校教育，甚至讨厌学习（见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Why_kids_hate_school?\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">孩子为什么讨厌学校？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>)<br/></li></ul><p data-pid=\"Gf0F6m1y\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/PISA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PISA</a> 的相关性似乎表明，<b>家庭作业</b>对考试结果是有益的。然而，芬兰是一个很好的反面例子：家庭作业很少，但效果很好。</p><p data-pid=\"g6VAMlTl\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Alfie_Kohn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Alfie Kohn</a> 是对家庭作业最强烈的批评者之一。他嘲讽道，家庭作业是「只有痛苦，没有收获」。见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.alfiekohn.org/article/rethinking-homework/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">重新思考家庭作业</a></p><hr/><p data-pid=\"OH-S53ru\">更多相关内容，欢迎关注我的收藏夹：</p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/collection/644178050\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">教育问题</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 自我导向/自定进度/自学 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"353404375\" href=\"#/post/353404375\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 学习中的强迫 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"351872034\" href=\"#/post/351872034\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 干扰 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"269974053\" href=\"#/post/269974053\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 论老鼠比受过学校教育的人更优越 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"272801606\" href=\"#/post/272801606\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 学习的基本规律 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"273225977\" href=\"#/post/273225977\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 为什么孩子们讨厌学校？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"70779863\" href=\"#/post/70779863\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"353404375","title":"自我导向/自定进度/自学","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":198,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"273225977","title":"学习的基本规律","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"70779863","title":"20 孩子们为什么讨厌学校？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":9,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"351872034","title":"学习中的强迫","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":57,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"272801606","title":"论老鼠比受过学校教育的人更优越","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":36,"minutes":5,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"269974053","title":"干扰","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"501186817","title":"家庭作业","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":65,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"665596499","title":"关于家庭作业存在的反思","author":"Alfie Kohn","votes":93,"minutes":12,"reason":"延伸深读 · Alfie Kohn"},{"id":"576166369","title":"Alfie Kohn","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"559705516","title":"学校让人沾染上的 100+ 恶习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8728,"minutes":132,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"369568521","title":"民主学校/在家上学/非学校教育","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":65,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1905718626289448075","title":"教育部禁止学生直接复制 AI 生成内容作为作业答案，执行难度如何？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":679,"minutes":14,"reason":"相似问答 · 679 赞同"},{"id":"55314373118","title":"苏州一区推出，“作业熔断”机制，你们怎么看？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":163,"minutes":14,"reason":"相似问答 · 163 赞同"},{"id":"1950157320052008314","title":"上海公办小学学生新学期喜提「每周无作业日」，比如有的学校每周五不布置家庭作业，你怎么看？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":49,"minutes":10,"reason":"相似问答 · 49 赞同"},{"id":"3432577755","title":"在教育中，写作业的意义何在？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":63,"minutes":6,"reason":"相似问答 · 63 赞同"},{"id":"3606095183","title":"在2025年的今天，为什么越来越多孩子把上学当成一种苦差事?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":473,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 473 赞同"}]}